#X obj 652 11 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 146 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 A complex echo-like effect \, inspired by the classic
Eventide effect of a similar name. The effect consists of a diffuser
(like a mini-reverb \, structurally similar to the one used in JPverb)
connected in a feedback system with a long \, modulated delay-line.
Excels at producing spacey washes of sound.;
#X text 240 184 Developed as part of the DEIND project.;
#X msg 50 272 1000 1000 0 \, 300 300 1000 \, 3000 500 1300 \, 0 100 1400;
#X obj 50 301 vline~;
#X obj 50 330 osc.saw~;
#X obj 50 359 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 213 359 ui.hsl;
