#X obj 250 759 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 759 @diffusion;
#X text 270 759 Shape of the diffusion unit. Values greater than 0.707
produce smooth exponential decay. Lower values produce a slower build-up
of echoes. Type: float. Default value: 0.5\. Range: [0\..0.99].;
#X obj 250 831 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 831 @drywet;
#X text 270 831 Proportion of mix between the original (dry) and 'effected'
(wet) signals. 0 - dry signal \, 1 - wet. Type: float. Default value:
1\. Range: [0\..1].;
#X obj 250 888 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 888 @feedback;
#X text 270 888 Amount of feedback for the delay line. Type: float.
